               <code code="34069-5" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="HOW SUPPLIED SECTION"/>
               <title>16 HOW SUPPLIED/STORAGE AND HANDLING</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Atropine Sulfate Injection, USP, 1 mg/10 mL (0.1 mg/mL), is supplied in single-dose syringes as follows:</paragraph>
                  <paragraph/>
                  <paragraph>NDC: 70518-3120-00</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>PACKAGING: 10 in 1 PACKAGE, 1 in 1 CARTON, 10 mL in 1 SYRINGE, TYPE 2</paragraph>
                  <paragraph/>
                  <paragraph>Store at 20°C to 25°C (68°F to 77°F); excursions permitted between 15°C and 30°C (59°F and 86°F). [See USP Controlled Room Temperature.]</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Rx Only</paragraph>
